<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Locate Animal</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Ranger (guild level 9, up to 60%), Druid (guild level 19)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast locate animal &lt;animal&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cast locate animal deer
</pre>
<p>The caster prays for a vision from the gods and senses where an animal 
is: the room it is in. It looks in your own area first, and then in the 
whole world. It finds only animals (beasts, birds, reptiles, amphibians, 
insects and worms); for anything else you only learn that it is not one.
</p><p>The animal's mind may turn the vision aside, and then you just feel 
slightly disoriented: the better your brain and your skill in the spell, 
against the animal's brain, the better you do. You must be standing. It 
is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate</a>
